WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/vehicles/components/telemetry-panels/ClimatePanel.tsx — a PURE presentational leaf
  fed `climateData: ClimateSnapshot | null | undefined` by its parent, plus `useUnits()`. Regions:
    GlassPanel(p-6 h-full) → h3.section-title[ <Thermometer text-cyan-300/> + t('common.climate') ]
      climateData ?
        → grid-cols-2: <MetricCard label=t('common.insideTemp')  value=formatTemperature(inside_temp_c)>
                       <MetricCard label=t('common.outsideTemp') value=formatTemperature(outside_temp_c)>
        → grid-cols-2: Driver Setpoint  = formatTemperature(driver_setpoint_c)
                       Passenger Setpoint = formatTemperature(passenger_setpoint_c)
        → HVAC State  = hvac_state ?? '—'
        → Fan Speed   = six width-stepped bars (w-1.5…w-4) filled when (fan_status ?? 0) >= level,
                        + the raw numeric (fan_status ?? 0); Fan glyph on the label.
        → chips (flex-wrap): Defrost (blue, active when defrost_mode && defrost_mode !== 'Off',
                        shows the raw mode else t('common.off')); Climate (green, t On/Off on
                        is_climate_on); Precondition (amber, t On/Off on is_preconditioning).
      : <EmptyState message=t('telemetry.noClimateData','No climate data available') />
  Data sources: `useTranslation` + `useUnits` (formatTemperature only). The web formatter is
  `fmtNumber(convertTempFromSI(°C, pref), 1) + °unit` with NO space and the em-dash sentinel for a
  non-finite reading (lib/unitConversion.ts L161/L345 + lib/numberFormat.ts safeNumber⇒0).

